WEBVTT

00:00:08.630 --> 00:00:11.190
Tougou-san is... gone.

00:00:11.920 --> 00:00:15.490
She disappeared from the photos, too.

00:00:15.490 --> 00:00:18.200
Just what is going on here?

00:00:18.820 --> 00:00:21.620
For now, let's find her!

00:00:25.990 --> 00:00:32.010
<i>I even promised Tougou-san
that I would remember her.</i>

00:00:32.550 --> 00:00:35.010
<i>And yet...!</i>

00:02:17.750 --> 00:02:21.570
We... couldn't find any clues, huh?

00:02:21.570 --> 00:02:25.850
It's like Tougou-san never
existed in the first place.

00:02:25.850 --> 00:02:27.870
Even her desk wasn't in the classroom.

00:02:27.870 --> 00:02:33.960
The encouragement note I got from everyone is missing this part right here.

00:02:33.960 --> 00:02:37.510
Tougou-senpai had written "Everyone is a pumpkin" here.

00:02:37.510 --> 00:02:40.580
That's just horrible.
It's like bullying.

00:02:40.580 --> 00:02:43.350
I'm sure the Taisha knows
what's going on.

00:02:43.350 --> 00:02:46.370
But they told me they didn't know anything.

00:02:46.370 --> 00:02:49.690
I got the same answer, too.

00:02:50.300 --> 00:02:53.970
Does this mean that they're
playing dumb again?

00:02:53.970 --> 00:02:57.570
It seems that the Taisha really
don't know anything.

00:02:57.570 --> 00:03:00.700
Nogi! Where have you been?

00:03:00.700 --> 00:03:02.460
Taisha Headquarters.

00:03:02.460 --> 00:03:10.080
I told them about Wasshi, but the priests appeared quite
alarmed when they heard this and said they didn't know.

00:03:10.680 --> 00:03:13.240
For even the Taisha
to be in the dark...

00:03:15.240 --> 00:03:17.300
Tougou-san...

00:03:17.300 --> 00:03:19.920
It looks like this is our
only option, now.

00:03:24.510 --> 00:03:26.470
Isn't this...

00:03:26.470 --> 00:03:28.710
The Hero System?

00:03:28.710 --> 00:03:33.540
They willingly complied after I got really mad and demanded that they hand them over to me.

00:03:33.540 --> 00:03:35.300
Let's go find her with this.

00:03:35.300 --> 00:03:36.960
Find her, you say?

00:03:36.960 --> 00:03:38.990
We can still transform, right?

00:03:38.990 --> 00:03:41.110
That's right, Nibosshi.

00:03:41.110 --> 00:03:44.870
Look, Wasshi's terminal is gone,

00:03:44.870 --> 00:03:50.330
but her signature doesn't
appear on my radar.

00:03:50.330 --> 00:03:54.780
Maybe Wasshi is somewhere
no one would suspect?

00:03:54.780 --> 00:03:56.590
In other words, that means...

00:03:57.930 --> 00:03:59.050
She's outside the wall?!

00:03:59.050 --> 00:04:00.800
Exactly.

00:04:00.800 --> 00:04:03.800
Tougou's pretty radical;
I wouldn't put it past her.

00:04:03.800 --> 00:04:07.680
That's why I think we should transform
into Heroes and go check it out.

00:04:08.640 --> 00:04:10.560
A fairy?!

00:04:10.560 --> 00:04:14.850
Will there be a price for our powers
when we become Heroes again?

00:04:14.850 --> 00:04:20.050
They told me that they made a new
version and removed Sange.

00:04:20.050 --> 00:04:22.480
That sounds awfully convenient.

00:04:22.480 --> 00:04:28.660
Sh-She's right! Even if they say it's a new system,
what if the same thing...?

00:04:28.660 --> 00:04:32.760
It's natural to be scared.
I know how you feel.

00:04:35.750 --> 00:04:39.960
Okay! If it's to find Tougou-san...

00:04:40.950 --> 00:04:42.050
Hold it.

00:04:42.050 --> 00:04:43.320
But...

00:04:43.320 --> 00:04:45.530
This isn't like the first time.

00:04:45.530 --> 00:04:50.220
As the club president, I don't want
anyone to transform recklessly.

00:04:50.220 --> 00:04:53.700
Don't just act on impulse now, got it?

00:04:53.700 --> 00:04:54.930
Okay...

00:04:54.930 --> 00:04:57.520
Nogi, the same goes for you, too.

00:04:57.520 --> 00:04:59.970
Yeah. Thank you.

00:04:59.970 --> 00:05:03.690
It's true that we've gone through horrible things, but...

00:05:04.480 --> 00:05:09.200
If we hadn't offered our bodies and fought as Heroes,
then the world would have ended.

00:05:09.200 --> 00:05:11.430
We had no other choice.

00:05:11.430 --> 00:05:15.460
The Taisha's way of handling it was incompetent,
but it wasn't anyone's fault.

00:05:15.460 --> 00:05:20.920
They assured me that they won't keep any secrets
from us regarding the Hero System anymore.

00:05:21.440 --> 00:05:26.010
I asked them directly and decided to believe them.

00:05:26.680 --> 00:05:29.780
That's why it's not like last time.

00:05:29.780 --> 00:05:34.310
I'm doing it out of my own will
this time, so that's why I'll go.

00:05:38.130 --> 00:05:39.440
I'll believe, too.

00:05:40.340 --> 00:05:41.880
Yuuna...

00:05:41.880 --> 00:05:47.420
I'm not sure about the people from the Taisha, but if
Sono-chan says she believes them, then I will, too.

00:05:47.420 --> 00:05:48.820
Yuuyu...

00:05:49.230 --> 00:05:52.210
Fuu-senpai, I've thought it through.

00:05:52.210 --> 00:05:53.540
I will go!

00:05:58.300 --> 00:06:02.170
Ah, geez! Don't go leaving
your president behind!

00:06:02.170 --> 00:06:03.630
Fuu-senpai!

00:06:04.070 --> 00:06:07.590
If both of you say so,
then I'll believe, too.

00:06:09.330 --> 00:06:15.750
Well, if a Hero Club member is missing, then it's her fellow
Hero Club members' job to look for her, right?

00:06:15.750 --> 00:06:17.410
Karin-chan!

00:06:17.410 --> 00:06:19.100
I'll go, too!

00:06:19.100 --> 00:06:21.230
Itsuki...

00:06:26.110 --> 00:06:28.070
Girls!

00:06:28.070 --> 00:06:32.380
Still, we're going outside the wall, right?
We don't know what might happen.

00:06:32.380 --> 00:06:35.440
Itsuki! Supplements! Pop some!

00:06:35.440 --> 00:06:36.180
Hey-

00:06:36.180 --> 00:06:37.960
This time I'll pop some!

00:06:37.960 --> 00:06:39.000
Itsuki?!

00:06:39.000 --> 00:06:39.820
Now then, I'll help myself!

00:06:39.820 --> 00:06:40.640
Stop!

00:06:40.640 --> 00:06:43.090
You have such wonderful friends.

00:06:43.090 --> 00:06:44.780
So do you, Sono-chan!

00:06:49.050 --> 00:06:54.890
With this new Hero System,
you start with a full Mankai gauge.

00:06:55.470 --> 00:07:01.310
The fairies still provide protection, but each time they do, the gauge will lose a charge.

00:07:01.770 --> 00:07:04.110
The gauge cannot be replenished.

00:07:04.110 --> 00:07:09.610
You can use Mankai when your gauge is full,
but doing so will instantly deplete all charges.

00:07:10.270 --> 00:07:14.030
Once the gauge is depleted, the fairy's protection will vanish.

00:07:14.620 --> 00:07:18.750
If you get hit by an attack after that,
it can endanger your life.

00:07:19.830 --> 00:07:23.080
This is the Post-Sange Hero System.

00:07:23.940 --> 00:07:27.920
I feel better about it now that
you explained everything.

00:07:27.920 --> 00:07:30.870
That's right! Now I feel
even more prepared!

00:07:30.870 --> 00:07:33.340
Cleaning up these petals
will be a pain, though...

00:07:39.020 --> 00:07:40.600
Inugami?!

00:07:44.030 --> 00:07:47.230
Gyuuki, it's been a while!
I'll be in your care again!

00:07:47.230 --> 00:07:49.440
Hey, I can't see in front of me!

00:07:49.440 --> 00:07:52.280
He really <i>is</i> attached to you, Onee-chan.

00:07:54.120 --> 00:07:55.460
You good?

00:07:55.460 --> 00:07:57.060
You brute!

00:07:57.060 --> 00:07:58.850
Same as always, huh?

00:07:58.850 --> 00:08:01.190
All things must pass.

00:08:14.870 --> 00:08:16.590
Sorry!

00:08:16.590 --> 00:08:18.140
Passing through!

00:08:23.420 --> 00:08:27.300
Things are gonna get pretty grim past
this point, so be careful, okay?

00:08:27.300 --> 00:08:31.450
I'll take the front line; Sonoko, you
support from the rear.

00:08:31.450 --> 00:08:34.410
Nibosshi, don't go too far ahead, okay?

00:08:36.140 --> 00:08:37.160
Sure.

00:08:38.660 --> 00:08:42.680
Itsuki? I'll make you some special udon tonight, okay?

00:08:42.680 --> 00:08:46.130
Sure! I'm looking forward to it, Onee-chan!

00:08:46.130 --> 00:08:49.090
Okay! Let's go!

00:08:54.590 --> 00:08:57.080
This sight's still as dreadful as always.

00:08:57.080 --> 00:09:00.100
No matter how many times I look at it,
it's simply not of this world.

00:09:00.100 --> 00:09:02.750
Wow! I got a response on the radar!

00:09:02.750 --> 00:09:04.240
Eh?! Where, where?

00:09:04.240 --> 00:09:05.980
Right here.

00:09:05.980 --> 00:09:08.180
Ah, it's Tougou-san!

00:09:08.180 --> 00:09:11.140
She really <i>was</i> outside of the wall!

00:09:11.140 --> 00:09:13.080
We'll be able to do this
somehow, Yuuna!

00:09:13.080 --> 00:09:14.120
Yeah!

00:09:14.120 --> 00:09:16.820
But she's closer than I thought.

00:09:19.500 --> 00:09:22.280
Are you sure it's in this direction...

00:09:22.280 --> 00:09:23.330
Eh?

00:09:23.330 --> 00:09:26.460
J-Just what is that?!

00:09:37.470 --> 00:09:39.280
Wow.

00:09:39.280 --> 00:09:41.360
It's over there, right?

00:09:41.360 --> 00:09:44.680
Yeah... it seems that Wasshi is inside of that.

00:09:45.200 --> 00:09:46.840
It's Tougou-san.

00:09:46.840 --> 00:09:49.770
Tougou-san became a black hole.

00:09:49.770 --> 00:09:54.080
Well, this is a first. I finally get to see you after a while and now you're a black hole.

00:09:54.080 --> 00:09:56.280
Onee-chan...

00:09:56.280 --> 00:09:58.910
There are a lot of
Vertexes around it.

00:09:59.550 --> 00:10:00.870
Let's check it out!

00:10:00.870 --> 00:10:02.620
But...

00:10:02.620 --> 00:10:04.480
how?

00:10:06.620 --> 00:10:08.210
Why is this happening now?!

00:10:10.790 --> 00:10:13.300
Thanks, Itsuki!

00:10:25.020 --> 00:10:27.230
Take that!

00:10:30.280 --> 00:10:31.850
Nice job, Sonoko!

00:10:31.850 --> 00:10:34.240
Ehehe... I got praised!

00:10:34.240 --> 00:10:36.660
But we're not going to get anything
done at this rate!

00:10:36.660 --> 00:10:38.740
How do we get up to Tougou?

00:10:38.740 --> 00:10:41.460
We can get up there
by taking a ship!

00:10:41.460 --> 00:10:42.990
Ship? What are yo- Sonoko?!

00:10:43.580 --> 00:10:45.260
Mankai!

00:10:54.160 --> 00:10:56.780
H-Hey! Don't use Mankai just like that!

00:10:56.780 --> 00:10:59.010
You'll lose your fairy protection!

00:10:59.010 --> 00:11:03.040
We didn't have a barrier back then,
so it's no big deal!

00:11:03.040 --> 00:11:04.730
It <i>is</i> a big deal!

00:11:04.730 --> 00:11:08.730
All right! This ship is bound for Wasshi! All aboard!

00:11:09.370 --> 00:11:12.320
Geez, you leave me no choice!

00:11:12.320 --> 00:11:14.080
Sorry to intrude!

00:11:14.080 --> 00:11:16.040
It's a really cool ship!

00:11:16.040 --> 00:11:18.300
Why do you and Tougou get all the good stuff?

00:11:18.300 --> 00:11:20.610
Mine is still the coolest!

00:11:20.610 --> 00:11:23.240
You're amazing, Sono-chan!

00:11:23.240 --> 00:11:25.240
Thanks, Yuuyu.

00:11:25.240 --> 00:11:29.520
Now, let's get going!

00:11:31.000 --> 00:11:34.000
<i>Wait for me, Tougou-san!</i>

00:11:55.630 --> 00:11:58.230
Are you guys okay? Is anyone
getting motion sickness?

00:11:58.790 --> 00:12:02.490
Forget motion sickness;
this is just insane!

00:12:02.490 --> 00:12:05.640
I wonder what's happening in there?

00:12:05.640 --> 00:12:07.200
Tougou-san!

00:12:11.210 --> 00:12:12.540
They're trying to intercept us.

00:12:13.580 --> 00:12:16.840
Are they defending this place?

00:12:18.460 --> 00:12:20.970
They've got us surrounded.

00:12:20.970 --> 00:12:23.570
I'll go to where Tougou-san is.

00:12:23.570 --> 00:12:24.590
Yuuna!

00:12:24.590 --> 00:12:26.800
I'll come back with her,
no matter what.

00:12:27.610 --> 00:12:29.430
Yuuyu...

00:12:29.430 --> 00:12:31.430
Wait! Are you sure about this?

00:12:31.430 --> 00:12:34.060
Geez. You better come back, Yuuna.

00:12:34.060 --> 00:12:35.310
Club Prez's orders!

00:12:35.310 --> 00:12:38.320
We'll beat the ones who
try to get in the way!

00:12:38.320 --> 00:12:42.400
There's no way to tell what might happen inside that thing, so push through with willpower!

00:12:42.400 --> 00:12:43.460
Yeah.

00:12:43.460 --> 00:12:45.240
Yuuyu.

00:12:45.240 --> 00:12:48.990
Please take care of Wasshi.

00:12:49.950 --> 00:12:51.830
Leave it to me, Sono-chan.

00:12:51.830 --> 00:12:53.640
Hold on tight!

00:12:53.640 --> 00:12:57.110
We'll fly there at once!

00:13:06.670 --> 00:13:09.260
I won't let you get in Yuuyu's way!

00:13:12.310 --> 00:13:13.770
Yuuyu, now!

00:13:13.770 --> 00:13:15.060
Got it!

00:13:15.830 --> 00:13:17.240
I'm off!

00:13:44.950 --> 00:13:47.180
I have to make it there.

00:13:52.590 --> 00:13:54.270
Tougou-san...

00:13:57.690 --> 00:13:59.860
Tougou-san...!

00:14:23.590 --> 00:14:26.270
A-An out-of-body experience?!

00:14:46.030 --> 00:14:52.950
Does this mean... If I'm destroyed,
my body will stay like this forever?

00:14:59.550 --> 00:15:00.750
Tougou-san?!

00:15:04.960 --> 00:15:13.470
Shortly after Sonocchi came to our middle school,
an event occurred that the Taisha failed to predict.

00:15:13.470 --> 00:15:20.970
Because I destroyed a part of the barrier,
the flames outside were kindled.

00:15:20.970 --> 00:15:25.650
At this rate, they were threatening to devour this world.

00:15:25.650 --> 00:15:29.420
The Taisha was forced to call
off their plans to resist...

00:15:29.420 --> 00:15:31.700
in order to break the deadlock.

00:15:34.140 --> 00:15:37.890
Was that just now one of
Tougou-san's memories?

00:15:37.890 --> 00:15:39.030
Tougou-san!

00:15:39.030 --> 00:15:40.760
You're in here after all, aren't you?!

00:15:40.760 --> 00:15:41.920
Are there more?!

00:15:46.210 --> 00:15:50.060
The only way to quell the raging flames is to conduct a Festival of the Fire Offering.

00:15:50.060 --> 00:15:53.390
That is, to offer Mikos, the ones capable
of hearing the voices of the gods,

00:15:53.390 --> 00:15:56.720
to the flames burning outside to beg
forgiveness from the Heavenly Gods.

00:15:57.260 --> 00:16:02.980
It's a ritual sacrifice that has already been conducted
once before- long ago, at the end of the Christian Era.

00:16:03.960 --> 00:16:10.240
Multiple Mikos in service of the Taisha have already been chosen to be the sacrifices.

00:16:11.020 --> 00:16:15.500
However, they say that I
can take their place,

00:16:15.500 --> 00:16:22.500
for I am unique in the sense that I possess both the qualities of a Hero and the powers of a Miko.

00:16:23.860 --> 00:16:25.620
I didn't even need
to think about it.

00:16:25.620 --> 00:16:28.170
I was the one who tore
the hole in the barrier.

00:16:28.170 --> 00:16:30.550
I must atone for my sin.

00:16:31.380 --> 00:16:33.620
As long as Yuuna-chan and
the others are safe...

00:16:34.380 --> 00:16:36.100
As long as it's just me...

00:16:37.800 --> 00:16:44.100
If I disappear, I'm sure that Yuuna-chan...
I'm sure that everyone will look for me.

00:16:44.100 --> 00:16:47.180
Shinju-sama, I beg of you...

00:16:47.810 --> 00:16:49.500
Please make it so they won't.

00:16:56.600 --> 00:16:58.210
Yuuna-chan...

00:17:02.060 --> 00:17:05.600
Tougou-san, you're always jumping the gun.

00:17:05.600 --> 00:17:08.320
You went and erased yourself.

00:17:11.550 --> 00:17:14.770
But I promised...

00:17:14.770 --> 00:17:17.220
that I would never leave
you alone, Tougou-san!

00:17:22.810 --> 00:17:25.100
That's why I'll save you-

00:17:25.820 --> 00:17:27.630
no matter how many times it takes!

00:17:35.060 --> 00:17:36.450
Huh?!

00:17:43.370 --> 00:17:46.330
I've been here before...

00:18:00.080 --> 00:18:01.680
I knew it.

00:18:01.680 --> 00:18:04.110
It's the place from back then...

00:18:08.210 --> 00:18:09.940
Tougou-san!

00:18:19.260 --> 00:18:21.910
What... is this?

00:18:23.910 --> 00:18:25.660
Tougou-san!

00:18:26.270 --> 00:18:28.290
This is awful...

00:18:28.290 --> 00:18:30.170
Tougou-san!

00:18:39.480 --> 00:18:42.300
I'll get you out of there!

00:19:01.830 --> 00:19:03.200
I don't care!

00:19:03.200 --> 00:19:05.700
Let Tougou-san go!

00:19:16.790 --> 00:19:19.880
Let's go back, Tougou-san!

00:19:26.230 --> 00:19:27.640
I did it!

00:19:27.640 --> 00:19:29.230
Now we can...

00:19:46.080 --> 00:19:47.830
Wh-What's going on?!

00:20:06.510 --> 00:20:07.620
Finally!

00:20:07.620 --> 00:20:08.550
She woke up!

00:20:08.550 --> 00:20:09.600
Tougou-san!

00:20:09.600 --> 00:20:11.300
Wasshi!

00:20:12.940 --> 00:20:15.060
Everyone...

00:20:15.060 --> 00:20:16.700
Where am I?

00:20:16.700 --> 00:20:19.360
You've been asleep the past few days.

00:20:19.360 --> 00:20:22.320
Did you save me?

00:20:22.320 --> 00:20:23.420
Yeah!

00:20:23.420 --> 00:20:28.010
But at this rate, the world
will be incinerated.

00:20:28.010 --> 00:20:29.840
We've heard about the situation.

00:20:29.840 --> 00:20:34.830
The flames have already stabilized,
so there's no need for sacrifices anymore.

00:20:34.830 --> 00:20:36.540
Did someone take my place?

00:20:36.540 --> 00:20:37.920
Nope.

00:20:37.920 --> 00:20:43.050
Tougou, apparently you got drained of enough life force to kill a normal person.

00:20:43.050 --> 00:20:45.550
Your duty must be finished because of that.

00:20:45.550 --> 00:20:48.090
But since you're tough,
you survived that.

00:20:48.090 --> 00:20:50.270
And we managed to pull you out in time.

00:20:50.270 --> 00:20:51.500
Something like that.

00:20:51.500 --> 00:20:54.390
Good thing you trained a lot!

00:20:54.390 --> 00:20:56.670
Apparently, your body is fine too!

00:20:56.670 --> 00:20:59.190
Did I really get saved?

00:20:59.190 --> 00:21:01.180
That's right. Totally in the green.

00:21:01.180 --> 00:21:03.080
Good job completing your duty!

00:21:03.080 --> 00:21:05.770
Well, you'll be hospitalized
for a while, though.

00:21:05.770 --> 00:21:09.330
And now the entire Hero
Club is back together!

00:21:10.640 --> 00:21:12.090
Girls...

00:21:12.090 --> 00:21:14.120
Tougou-san, I'm sorry.

00:21:14.120 --> 00:21:14.960
Eh?

00:21:14.960 --> 00:21:19.180
I promised that I would
never forget you,

00:21:19.180 --> 00:21:21.210
but I forgot you
for several days.

00:21:22.290 --> 00:21:24.840
No, I'm the one who
should be sorry.

00:21:24.840 --> 00:21:27.130
I made you so worried...

00:21:27.130 --> 00:21:28.610
That doesn't matter!

00:21:28.610 --> 00:21:31.100
I would've probably done the same.

00:21:31.100 --> 00:21:34.500
Next time, tell us everything properly.

00:21:34.500 --> 00:21:35.530
Okay.

00:21:35.530 --> 00:21:38.700
Well, let's call it even.

00:21:38.700 --> 00:21:40.610
We forgot about you, after all.

00:21:40.610 --> 00:21:44.810
But even so, you eventually
remembered me.

00:21:44.810 --> 00:21:46.530
This isn't a dream, right?

00:21:46.530 --> 00:21:48.720
That's right, Tougou-san.

00:21:48.720 --> 00:21:50.170
Thank you...

00:21:50.170 --> 00:21:52.620
There, there.

00:21:52.620 --> 00:21:54.610
That's everything, I guess?

00:21:54.610 --> 00:21:55.660
Yup!

